 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "As in part 1, plus rules: a list of strings \"field,value\" where field is card_number, merchant or max_amount. A request is declined when its card_number equals the value of a card_number rule, its merchant equals the value of a merchant rule, or its amount is greater than the value of a max_amount rule; otherwise it is approved. Return [unique_id, \"APPROVE\" or \"DECLINE\"] per request in timestamp order (ties keep input order).",
